        {
            "+content": "Arranged by the mysterious Fumiya Itou, seven men with distinct personalities live together in a shared house known as Charisma House. Each member embraces a distinct form of charisma, from Iori's devotion to others and Kei's rebellious nature to Amahiko's flamboyance, Terra's vanity, and Ohse's antics, keeping the household lively and challenging Rikai's efforts to maintain order. Everyone strives to develop his own unique charisma while navigating the challenges of communal life. Despite their unusual habits and differences, they remain unfazed by outside criticism, turning adversity into fuel for their daily pursuit of greater charisma.",
            "+@gid": "2762811925",
            "+@type": "Plot Summary"
        },
